---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
import { withBase } from '../../lib/url'

// Shown wherever the blog would normally be, while `BLOG_PUBLISHED` is false.
const ctaGhost =
  'inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-mono-label text-text-primary border border-border-dark px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:border-primary transition-all'
---

<section class="max-w-2xl" data-reveal>
  <span
    class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-mono-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-primary border border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 rounded-full px-3 py-1"
  >
    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse"></span>
    Work in progress
  </span>

  <h1
    class="font-sans font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary mt-6 text-[clamp(1.875rem,4vw,3rem)] leading-[1.15]"
  >
    The blog is being rebuilt.
  </h1>

  <p class="text-body-lg text-text-muted mt-6">
    I am reinventing how I write here: the format, the scope, and what a post
    has to earn before it goes up. That takes time, so the previous writing is
    offline while the new approach comes together.
  </p>

  <p class="text-body-md text-text-muted mt-4">
    Nothing is lost, and nothing new goes up until it is worth reading. Check
    back later.
  </p>

  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-8">
    <a href={withBase('about')} class={ctaGhost}>
      More about me
      <Icon name="material-symbols:arrow-right-alt" class="text-[18px]" />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
